### Login first to get authToken cookie
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "strEmail": "neminath@admin.com",
  "strPassword": "Admin@123"
}

### Upload Profile Image (requires authentication)
# You need to replace <YOUR_IMAGE_PATH> with an actual image file path
POST http://localhost:5244/api/auth/upload-profile-image
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< C:\path\to\your\image.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### Get Current User Info (should now include strProfileImg)
GET http://localhost:5244/api/auth/me

### Delete Profile Image (requires authentication)
DELETE http://localhost:5244/api/auth/delete-profile-image

### Access uploaded image directly
# After uploading, the URL will be something like:
# GET http://localhost:5244/uploads/profiles/c6fbc527-0d87-453a-a4da-e49216a0bef1_638718123456789.jpg
